{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33870","headline":"奉和鲁望四明山九题 潺湲洞 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望四明山九题 潺湲洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴宫何处渊，到此洞潺湲。\n敲碎一轮月，熔销半段天。\n响高吹谷动，势急歕云旋。\n料得深秋夜，临流尽古仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33870.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33870","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}